Epic_Vulkoor&#39;s_Chosen\" title=\"Named item sets\">Epic Vulkoor's Chosen</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+20 Artifact bonus to Poison Resistance<br />+2 Artifact bonus to Sneak Attack Dice<br />+2 Artifact bonus to Saving Throws<br />+2 Artifact bonus to Dexterity and Constitution</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Epic_Windlasher&#39;s_Ferocity\" title=\"Named item sets\">Epic Windlasher's Ferocity</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Named_item_sets#Epic_Windlasher&#39;s_Ferocity\" title=\"Named item sets\">Epic Windlasher's Ferocity</a>:</b> 2 Pieces Equipped:<br />+10% Artifact bonus to Doublestrike and Doubleshot<br />+10 Artifact bonus to Melee and Ranged Power</span></span></li></ul>\n</ul></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Epic_Gem_of_Many_Facets.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Epic_Gem_of_Many_Facets.png/420px-Epic_Gem_of_Many_Facets.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"581\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Epic_Gem_of_Many_Facets.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><a href=\"/page/Legendary_Crafting\" title=\"Legendary Crafting\">Legendary Crafting</a> to <a href=\"/page/Item:Legendary_Gem_of_Many_Facets\" title=\"Item:Legendary Gem of Many Facets\">Legendary Gem of Many Facets</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>From this chain hangs a gem that is very finely cut, giving it countless glittering faces. It can take the place of various other items for the purpose of activating certain set bonuses.</i>\n<p>This item will randomly choose from available set bonuses whenever it is re-acquired or upgraded to a higher level version. This item is also keyed for <a href=\"/page/Essence_Crafting\" title=\"Essence Crafting\">Essence Crafting</a>, and may be Disjuncted so that it can be crafted upon. Note that upgrading this item to a higher level version through Epic or Legendary Crafting will destroy what has been crafted on it, and will also re-roll available set bonuses.<i></i>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span></li>\n<li>You can reroll the sets for free at <a href=\"/page/Legacy_Altar_of_Epic_Rituals\" title=\"Legacy Altar of Epic Rituals\">Legacy Altar of Epic Rituals</a>. (This destroys all augments, adamantine rituals, Curses or Essence Crafting enhancements.)</li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817165934\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.142 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.195 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 10294/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 92589/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 53291/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip